Read the following files for complete project guidance before generating code:

- AGENTS.md — Project-wide architecture, module ownership, coding conventions, and critical rules
- {Module}/AGENTS.md — Module-specific instructions (e.g., Database/AGENTS.md, UI/AGENTS.md)
- CONTRIBUTING.md — Development workflow, TDD requirements, coding standards, PR process
- ARCHITECTURE.md — System architecture, data flow, and dependencies
